          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "what they need in order to be satisfied. Blessed is the person who truly trusts in Hashem and is secure in his belief that all Hashem does is for his best. נַעַר הָיִיתִי גַּם זָקַנְתִּי—I was young, and have now grown old, and never did I see a tzaddik who was forsaken (by Hashem), whose children had to go begging for food. Hashem will give strength to His nation; Hashem will bless his nation with peace."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
